shiver.text_en:
Once per Turn Instant - {r}: You may put an arrow card from your hand face up into an empty arsenal zone you control. If you do, choose 1;

It gains +1{p} until end of turn.
It gains dominate until end of turn.

voltaire_strike_twice.text_en:
Twice per Turn Instant - {r}: You may put an arrow card from your hand face up into an empty arsenal zone you control. If you do, choose 1;

It gains +1{p} until end of turn.
It gains go again until end of turn.
